      "content": "Wait, sorry, did you say \"invisible goblin\"? I'm just trying to understand the science behind it. Can you stick to the actual biological process? How do the bacteria and the yeast compete or cooperate without the magic stuff? I'm mostly interested in the chemical side of how they manage the pH levels.",
